<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko"><head>{{>layout/favicon}}<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>{{objekt.collectionId}} · 오브젝트 상세</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-[#0d0e12] text-white">{{>layout/header}}<main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-8">
<a href="/cosmo/objekt" class="text-sm text-teal-300">← 오브젝트 목록</a><div class="mt-5 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04]"><img id="objekt-image" src="{{objekt.frontImage}}" data-front="{{objekt.frontImage}}" data-back="{{objekt.backImage}}" alt="{{objekt.collectionId}}" class="aspect-[2/3] w-full object-contain" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='{{objekt.thumbnailImage}}'"><button type="button" id="flip-image" class="w-full border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-teal-200">앞면 / 뒷면 전환</button></div>
<section class="self-center"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-teal-300">OBJEKT DETAIL</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">{{objekt.collectionId}}</h1>
<dl class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm"><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-3"><dt class="text-slate-400">멤버</dt><dd>{{objekt.member}}</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-3"><dt class="text-slate-400">시즌</dt><dd>{{objekt.season}}</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-3"><dt class="text-slate-400">클래스</dt><dd>{{objekt.class}}</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-3"><dt class="text-slate-400">번호</dt><dd>{{objekt.collectionNo}}</dd></div></dl>
<section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-4"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">상세 설명</h2>{{#objektDescription}}<p class="mt-2 whitespace-pre-wrap text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">{{objektDescription}}</p>{{/objektDescription}}{{^objektDescription}}<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">아직 등록된 상세 설명이 없습니다.</p>{{/objektDescription}}
{{#isAdmin}}
<form method="post" action="/cosmo/objekt/detail/{{objektKey}}/description" class="mt-4 space-y-3"><label for="objektDescriptionInput" class="block text-sm text-slate-300">설명 추가 또는 수정</label><textarea id="objektDescriptionInput" name="description" rows="5" maxlength="10000" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/30 p-3 text-sm text-white" placeholder="이 오브젝트의 특징, 발매 정보, 교환 시 참고 사항 등을 적어 주세요.">{{objektDescription}}</textarea><button type="submit" class="rounded-xl bg-teal-300 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-slate-950">설명 저장</button></form>
{{/isAdmin}}
</section>
<form method="post" action="/cosmo/objekt/detail/{{objektKey}}/favorite" class="mt-6"><button class="w-full rounded-xl border border-pink-400/40 bg-pink-400/10 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-pink-200 hover:bg-pink-400/20" type="submit">{{#isFavorite}}♥ 찜 해제{{/isFavorite}}{{^isFavorite}}♡ 찜하기{{/isFavorite}}</button></form>
<a href="/cosmo/objekt/member?name={{objekt.member}}" class="mt-3 block rounded-xl border border-white/10 px-5 py-3 text-center text-sm hover:border-teal-300/50">이 멤버의 오브젝트 더 보기</a><a href="/article/trade/new" class="mt-3 block rounded-xl bg-teal-300 px-5 py-3 text-center font-semibold text-slate-950">교환 게시글 작성</a></section></div></main>
<script>(()=>{const i=document.getElementById('objekt-image');document.getElementById('flip-image').addEventListener('click',()=>{const b=i.dataset.showingBack==='true';const n=b?i.dataset.front:i.dataset.back;if(n)i.src=n;i.dataset.showingBack=b?'false':'true';});})();</script></body></html>